        <dl style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 6px 14px; margin: 0px;">
          <div style="display: contents;">
            <dt style="opacity: 0.7;">
              "Capacity"
            <dd style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; word-break: break-word;">
              "1,000,000 sats"
          <div style="display: contents;">
            <dt style="opacity: 0.7;">
              "Peer"
            <dd style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; word-break: break-word;">
              "Bitcorn treasury hub"
          <div style="display: contents;">
            <dt style="opacity: 0.7;">
              "Speed"
            <dd style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; word-break: break-word;">
              "Economy (about 1 sat/vB)"
          <div style="display: contents;">
            <dt style="opacity: 0.7;">
              "Address"
            <dd class="ident" style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; word-break: break-word;">
              "198.51.100.7:9735"
        <p style="margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0px; opacity: 0.85;">
          "Funding a channel is an on-chain transaction. The mining fee is spent whether or not you close the channel later."
      <div style="margin-top: 14px;">
        <label for="action-confirm-challenge" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">
          "Type the amount to confirm: 1,000,000"
        <input autocomplete="off" class="form-input action-confirm-input" id="action-confirm-challenge" inputmode="numeric" style="width: 100%; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;" type="text" value="" prop:value="" prop:disabled=false>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 16px;">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" disabled="" style="flex: 1 1 0%;" prop:disabled=true>
        "Open channel"
      <button class="btn btn-outline" prop:disabled=false>
        "Cancel"
calls: {"openMemberChannel":[],"getTreasuryInfo":1}"
`;

